    "The real dZ/hm delivery overwrites the first existing empty widget. The hand array doesnot append a new slot. useDevilItem cleanup replaces that devil with another empty placeholder. Two supplied devils followed by an ordinary artifact still finish with exactly one occupied slot.",
    "When the last empty widget receives a devil,the gift branch suppresses the ordinary final sort. A later supplied ordinary artifact fills the same reserved slot and allows the final sort. Retained miracle and unrelated ordinary widgets stay in their original hand array.",
    "The serial event queue disables controls,awaits supplied events inFIFOorder,andreactivates only after the supplied queue empties. Reentrant supplied events are buffered. It never generates another gift or automatic devil usage by observing a devil category.",
